@HostAddress = https://localhost:7088
Accept: application/json

### Categories
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/categories

### Attractions (search + category)
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/attractions?search=tea&categories=Nature

### Attraction detail
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/attractions/1

### Admin login
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "manager",
  "password": "Manager123"
}

### Current admin
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/auth/me

### Logout
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/auth/logout
